## 📁 Repository Structure

```text
deepagent_writer/
│
├── .env                          # API keys and environment variables
├── requirements.txt              # Production Python dependencies
├── create_skills.py              # Script to generate AgentSkills.io registry
├── main.py                       # CLI Entry point with HITL prompt
│
├── skills/                       # AgentSkills.io registry (Markdown + YAML Frontmatter)
│   ├── redaction_feynman.md
│   ├── redaction_eli5_analogy.md
│   ├── redaction_socratic_first_principles.md
│   ├── redaction_engineering_case_study.md
│   ├── redaction_comparative_battle.md
│   ├── excalidraw_pipeline_flow.md
│   ├── excalidraw_tensor_matrix.md
│   ├── excalidraw_agent_state_machine.md
│   ├── excalidraw_comparative_split.md
│   └── excalidraw_geometric_intuition.md
│
├── workspace/                    # Sandboxed file directory generated by agents
│   ├── research_notes.md
│   ├── draft.md
│   ├── diagrams_spec.md
│   └── final_article.md
│
├── static/                       # Single Page Application
│   └── index.html                # Tailwind CSS + Excalidraw UMD + SSE Frontend
│
└── src/
    ├── __init__.py
    ├── config.py                 # LLM Factory (OpenRouter, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenAI)
    ├── prompts.py                # Isolated System Prompts in English
    ├── skills_manager.py         # AgentSkills.io Parser & Registry Manager
    ├── tools.py                  # Filesystem Sandbox, Python Sandbox & Tavily Search
    ├── state.py                  # LangGraph DeepAgentState TypedDict
    ├── agents.py                 # Sub-Agents (Researcher, Writer, Excalidraw, Merger)
    ├── graph.py                  # LangGraph StateGraph & Postgres Checkpointer
    ├── celery_app.py             # Celery Instance Configuration
    ├── tasks.py                  # Celery Tasks & Redis Pub/Sub Streaming
    └── api.py                    # FastAPI Web Server (CRUD, SSE, HITL)
```

---

## 🎓 Skills Registry (AgentSkills.io Standard)

The system automatically loads 10 specialized skills from `skills/` using YAML metadata:

### 📝 Pedagogical Redaction Skills
1. **`redaction-feynman-deep-dive`**: Simplifies complex AI math (Attention, LoRA matrix rank) in 4 intuitive steps.
2. **`redaction-eli5-analogy`**: Explains low-level hardware optimizations (Quantization, KV Cache) using extended physical metaphors.
3. **`redaction-socratic-first-principles`**: Explores historical architectural failures to guide readers to new solutions.
4. **`redaction-engineering-case-study`**: Production-focused implementation guides with benchmarks and typed code.
5. **`redaction-comparative-battle`**: Head-to-head technical comparisons (LangChain vs LangGraph, LoRA vs QLoRA).

### 🎨 Excalidraw Visual Diagram Skills
1. **`excalidraw-pipeline-flow`**: Sequential execution flows, data pipelines, and RAG generation.
2. **`excalidraw-tensor-matrix`**: Tensor transformations, Q/K/V matrix multiplications, and rank decomposition.
3. **`excalidraw-agent-state-machine`**: LangGraph circular loops, router nodes, and HITL interrupts.
4. **`excalidraw-comparative-split`**: Side-by-side "Before vs After" visual canvas splits.
5. **`excalidraw-geometric-intuition`**: 2D/3D coordinate vector spaces, embeddings, and loss landscapes.

