## ⚡ Quick Start & Installation

### 1. Prerequisites
Ensure you have the following installed on your system:
* **Python 3.10+**
* **Redis Server** (running on port `6379`)
* **PostgreSQL Server** (running on port `5432`)

### 2. Clone Repository & Install Dependencies
```bash
git clone https://github.com/NchourupouoM/deepagent_writer.git
cd deepagent_writer

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # On Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 3. Setup Environment Variables
Create a `.env` file in the root directory:
```bash
# LangSmith Observability
LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2=true
LANGCHAIN_ENDPOINT="https://api.smith.langchain.com"
LANGCHAIN_API_KEY="your_langsmith_api_key"
LANGCHAIN_PROJECT="deep-agent-medium-writer"

# LLM Providers (OpenRouter Recommended)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY="sk-or-v1-..."
OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="sk-ant-..."
GOOGLE_API_KEY="AIzaSy..."

# Search API
TAVILY_API_KEY="tvly-..."

# Redis & PostgreSQL Infrastructure
REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379/0"
POSTGRES_DB_URI="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/medium_writer_db?sslmode=disable"
```

### 4. Initialize Database & Generate Skills
```bash
# Create PostgreSQL Database
psql -U postgres -c "CREATE DATABASE medium_writer_db;"

# Generate AgentSkills.io files in skills/
python create_skills.py
```

---

## 🚀 Running the System

To run the complete production stack, open **3 separate terminal windows**:

### Terminal 1: Start Redis Server
```bash
redis-server
# Or using Docker: docker run -d -p 6379:6379 redis:alpine
```

### Terminal 2: Start Celery Worker
```bash
celery -A src.celery_app worker --loglevel=info
```

### Terminal 3: Start FastAPI Backend
```bash
uvicorn src.api:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000 --reload
```

Access the Web Dashboard at **`http://127.0.0.1:8000`** in your browser!

---

## 📡 API Endpoints Summary

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `POST` | `/api/articles` | Initiates a new article generation task (Dispatches Celery job). |
| `GET` | `/api/articles` | Lists all article generation sessions and their statuses. |
| `GET` | `/api/articles/{thread_id}` | Gets thread state details and next execution step. |
| `GET` | `/api/articles/{thread_id}/stream` | **SSE Endpoint** streaming real-time node execution from Redis. |
| `POST` | `/api/articles/{thread_id}/hitl` | Submits Human-in-the-Loop decision (`approve` or `revise`). |
| `GET` | `/api/articles/{thread_id}/files/{filename}` | Fetches workspace files (`final_article.md`, `draft.md`, etc.). |
| `DELETE` | `/api/articles/{thread_id}` | Deletes session thread state from memory. |

